  "audio": "004.to-see-where.mp3",
  "paragraph": 4,
  "text": "To see where the architecture begins, separate any AI product into three distinct layers. At the bottom sits the model, a stateless next-token engine like Claude, GPT, or Gemini. In the middle sits the harness: the runtime loop, tool definitions, context manager, state persistence, and safety gates that power Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI, Cursor, and Windsurf Cascade under the hood. On top sits the application layer, the terminal, editor pane, or pull-request workflow you actually click and type inside.",
